; Assembler setup PDS loaded from the project directory before a build
; (editor manual 9.2.8). The original binary SETUP.PDS is not in this dump.
; ROBIN.PRJ is the project file list, not this setup.
;
; Assembler menu item 1, "Swap < and >" (editor manual 9.2.3).
; The source directive for the same switch is `option 0,<value>`.
;   0   > is the high byte, < is the low byte
;   1   > is the low byte,  < is the high byte
; The 6502 manual default is 1: the arrow points at the byte returned.
; The Asia cartridge matches 1. Magician's source sets 0.
option 0,1
